{
  "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Radio_Host",
  "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
  "duration_seconds": 419.0,
  "decode": "passed",
  "video_stream_identical": true,
  "audio_streams": 1,
  "subtitle_cues": 86,
  "video_sha256": "dfaea1f2c5b923bb5f90e6833dc9eb2ae9f659b019f76520ddc5f12f207aee6b",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "VO01.1",
      "start": 1.379,
      "end": 7.2724375000000006,
      "window_end": 7.3,
      "text": "想象一下，你偶然发现一份简短的电影剧本，其中描写了一个人与 AI 助手之间的一幕。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 1; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO01.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bb1376fc5a31506cda11750c4b1e16ab7f237bd6e99134c9744d6c93cb52a733",
      "source_in": 0.17228100000000002,
      "source_out": 7.0059059999999995,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1.1255092514004414
    },
    {
      "id": "VO01.2",
      "start": 7.38,
      "end": 10.63284375,
      "window_end": 12.1,
      "text": "剧本中写着这个人向 AI 提出的问题，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 2; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO01.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bb1376fc5a31506cda11750c4b1e16ab7f237bd6e99134c9744d6c93cb52a733",
      "source_in": 7.0059059999999995,
      "source_out": 10.636375000000001,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.07065365144153013,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO01.3",
      "start": 12.1,
      "end": 13.953875,
      "window_end": 14.5,
      "text": "但 AI 的回答部分被撕掉了。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 3; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO01.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bb1376fc5a31506cda11750c4b1e16ab7f237bd6e99134c9744d6c93cb52a733",
      "source_in": 10.636375000000001,
      "source_out": 12.862078,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.41600311791383326,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO01.4",
      "start": 16.7,
      "end": 21.62046875,
      "window_end": 22.0,
      "text": "假设你还有一台强大的神奇机器：输入任意文本，它就能合理预测下一个词。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 4; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO01.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bb1376fc5a31506cda11750c4b1e16ab7f237bd6e99134c9744d6c93cb52a733",
      "source_in": 12.862078,
      "source_out": 17.973813,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.08661314739229198,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO02.1",
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 25.2681875,
      "window_end": 25.3,
      "text": "你可以把现有内容输入机器，让它接着写完剧本，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 5; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO02.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "a9181b4e76bb18c8abe9d7127b5203cba3bb6ed447add2ef8fc4060414142caa",
      "source_in": 0.155625,
      "source_out": 4.006703,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1.010043960244648
    },
    {
      "id": "VO02.2",
      "start": 25.3,
      "end": 28.494062500000002,
      "window_end": 29.0,
      "text": "看看它会用哪个词，作为 AI 回答的开头，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 6; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO02.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "a9181b4e76bb18c8abe9d7127b5203cba3bb6ed447add2ef8fc4060414142caa",
      "source_in": 4.006703,
      "source_out": 7.433156,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.06993099161858796,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO02.3",
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 33.03109375,
      "window_end": 33.5,
      "text": "再把不断增长的剧本反复输入，直到补全整段对话。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 7; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO02.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "a9181b4e76bb18c8abe9d7127b5203cba3bb6ed447add2ef8fc4060414142caa",
      "source_in": 7.433156,
      "source_out": 11.7140315,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.24354941634375216,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO02.4",
      "start": 33.5,
      "end": 36.6293125,
      "window_end": 36.64,
      "text": "你与聊天机器人交流时，发生的正是这个过程。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 8; 经实际开场画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO02.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "a9181b4e76bb18c8abe9d7127b5203cba3bb6ed447add2ef8fc4060414142caa",
      "source_in": 11.7140315,
      "source_out": 15.485406,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.09628452514423458,
      "local_tempo": 1.2021402733118969
    },
    {
      "id": "VO03.1",
      "start": 36.64,
      "end": 42.55515625,
      "window_end": 44.079,
      "text": "大语言模型是一个复杂的数学函数，它能根据已有文本预测下一个词。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 9",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO03.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "3027bb45fdcf2187356be36fb3f610f853b8e48962f36da7f6c0c25adc47b206",
      "source_in": 0.14728100000000002,
      "source_out": 6.1632655,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO03.2",
      "start": 44.079,
      "end": 46.362812500000004,
      "window_end": 46.839,
      "text": "不过，它并非确定地预测某一个词，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 10",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO03.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "3027bb45fdcf2187356be36fb3f610f853b8e48962f36da7f6c0c25adc47b206",
      "source_in": 6.1632655,
      "source_out": 8.732328500000001,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.18764484313510366,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO03.3",
      "start": 46.839,
      "end": 50.51965625,
      "window_end": 51.02,
      "text": "而是为所有可能的后续词分别赋予一个概率。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 11",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO03.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "3027bb45fdcf2187356be36fb3f610f853b8e48962f36da7f6c0c25adc47b206",
      "source_in": 8.732328500000001,
      "source_out": 12.594719,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.128074542937604,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO04.1",
      "start": 51.02,
      "end": 57.480250000000005,
      "window_end": 58.899,
      "text": "要构建聊天机器人，可以先写一段文本，描述用户与一个假想 AI 助手的对话。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 12",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO04.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "a1af6d872406ed14e12772f3e8e2ada7d7eeb3ab1da60d144bf93f1f366ee13a",
      "source_in": 0.13184400000000002,
      "source_out": 6.908094,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO04.2",
      "start": 58.899,
      "end": 62.4814375,
      "window_end": 63.439,
      "text": "再把用户输入的内容加进去，作为这段对话的开头。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 13",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO04.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "a1af6d872406ed14e12772f3e8e2ada7d7eeb3ab1da60d144bf93f1f366ee13a",
      "source_in": 6.908094,
      "source_out": 10.847406,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.19475159637188266,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO05.1",
      "start": 63.439,
      "end": 68.61253125,
      "window_end": 69.9,
      "text": "接着让模型反复预测：这个假想的 AI 助手会用哪个词继续回答。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 14",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO05.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "b9ce9e4edd48d0bced25a3a759d014369d7981f9f07815d6b5c6cbb1d398117b",
      "source_in": 0.080562,
      "source_out": 5.4394685,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO05.2",
      "start": 69.9,
      "end": 72.31675,
      "window_end": 72.519,
      "text": "这些生成的内容就会呈现给用户。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 15",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO05.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "b9ce9e4edd48d0bced25a3a759d014369d7981f9f07815d6b5c6cbb1d398117b",
      "source_in": 5.4394685,
      "source_out": 8.2110935,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.16028902078609164,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO05.3",
      "start": 72.519,
      "end": 78.41575,
      "window_end": 79.57900000000001,
      "text": "如果允许它在生成过程中随机选取概率较低的词，输出往往会显得更加自然。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 16",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO05.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "b9ce9e4edd48d0bced25a3a759d014369d7981f9f07815d6b5c6cbb1d398117b",
      "source_in": 8.2110935,
      "source_out": 14.300938,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.09199523771730966,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO06.1",
      "start": 79.57900000000001,
      "end": 82.0810625,
      "window_end": 83.459,
      "text": "这意味着，尽管模型本身是确定性的，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 17",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO06.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "3d3844e4273a32291f58792abce13b2afcea577ffc9a06b01d50249943975686",
      "source_in": 0.15446900000000002,
      "source_out": 2.806172,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO06.2",
      "start": 83.459,
      "end": 87.07996875,
      "window_end": 87.119,
      "text": "同一个提示词每次运行，通常也会得到不同的回答。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 18",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO06.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "3d3844e4273a32291f58792abce13b2afcea577ffc9a06b01d50249943975686",
      "source_in": 2.806172,
      "source_out": 6.947078,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.0685000116618073,
      "local_tempo": 1.0001980027548218
    },
    {
      "id": "VO06.3",
      "start": 87.119,
      "end": 90.389625,
      "window_end": 92.59899999999999,
      "text": "模型通过处理海量文本，学习如何做出这些预测。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 19",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO06.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "3d3844e4273a32291f58792abce13b2afcea577ffc9a06b01d50249943975686",
      "source_in": 6.947078,
      "source_out": 10.613063,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.04786517201166163,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO07.1",
      "start": 92.59899999999999,
      "end": 94.16621874999998,
      "window_end": 94.219,
      "text": "这些文本通常来自互联网。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 20",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO07.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "dc1b962882c0dda2c6fb443bfb155e55a6dfecb1c3362d1dd80c46e8a223f4bb",
      "source_in": 0.10259399999999999,
      "source_out": 1.821891,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO07.2",
      "start": 94.219,
      "end": 98.63,
      "window_end": 98.63900000000001,
      "text": "以训练 GPT-3 所用的文本量为例，一个普通人要把它们全部读完，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 21",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO07.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "dc1b962882c0dda2c6fb443bfb155e55a6dfecb1c3362d1dd80c46e8a223f4bb",
      "source_in": 1.821891,
      "source_out": 6.8806875000000005,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.24340320922597902,
      "local_tempo": 1.0760748861047797
    },
    {
      "id": "VO07.3",
      "start": 98.63900000000001,
      "end": 101.73265625,
      "window_end": 101.779,
      "text": "即使每天二十四小时不停地阅读，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 22",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO07.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "dc1b962882c0dda2c6fb443bfb155e55a6dfecb1c3362d1dd80c46e8a223f4bb",
      "source_in": 6.8806875000000005,
      "source_out": 10.223281,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.3947807370460614,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO07.4",
      "start": 101.779,
      "end": 102.84293749999999,
      "window_end": 103.3,
      "text": "也需要超过两千六百年。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 23",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO07.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "dc1b962882c0dda2c6fb443bfb155e55a6dfecb1c3362d1dd80c46e8a223f4bb",
      "source_in": 10.223281,
      "source_out": 11.5079685,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.3192564966663287,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO07.5",
      "start": 103.3,
      "end": 107.157125,
      "window_end": 107.419,
      "text": "此后出现的更大模型，训练所用的文本还要多得多。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 24",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO07.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "dc1b962882c0dda2c6fb443bfb155e55a6dfecb1c3362d1dd80c46e8a223f4bb",
      "source_in": 11.5079685,
      "source_out": 15.583063,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.273596193539106,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO08.1",
      "start": 107.419,
      "end": 111.19387499999999,
      "window_end": 111.939,
      "text": "你可以把训练理解为：调节一台大型机器上的许多旋钮。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 25",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO08.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5f300ad00bb0e848c54a27a44649d5a3e8352a5b71e59c1cb8b1c7ea4b07ce1d",
      "source_in": 0.21668700000000002,
      "source_out": 4.454922,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO08.2",
      "start": 111.939,
      "end": 117.40968749999999,
      "window_end": 117.85900000000001,
      "text": "语言模型的行为，完全由许多不同的连续数值决定。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 26",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO08.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5f300ad00bb0e848c54a27a44649d5a3e8352a5b71e59c1cb8b1c7ea4b07ce1d",
      "source_in": 4.454922,
      "source_out": 10.5389065,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.83220052717179,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO08.3",
      "start": 117.85900000000001,
      "end": 120.38378125000001,
      "window_end": 120.459,
      "text": "这些数值通常被称为“参数”或“权重”。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 27",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO08.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5f300ad00bb0e848c54a27a44649d5a3e8352a5b71e59c1cb8b1c7ea4b07ce1d",
      "source_in": 10.5389065,
      "source_out": 13.155438,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.4244112306278822,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO09.1",
      "start": 120.459,
      "end": 125.36428125,
      "window_end": 127.299,
      "text": "改变这些参数，就会改变模型针对给定输入给出的下一个词的概率。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 28",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO09.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5ecea281ecbbb1c137a843a771e3b660d0ba51d38098ce891136354d04101139",
      "source_in": 0.29381199999999996,
      "source_out": 5.5699065,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO09.2",
      "start": 127.299,
      "end": 132.02425,
      "window_end": 134.059,
      "text": "大语言模型之所以“大”，是因为它可以拥有数千亿个参数。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 29",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO09.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5ecea281ecbbb1c137a843a771e3b660d0ba51d38098ce891136354d04101139",
      "source_in": 5.5699065,
      "source_out": 10.687875,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.29673526781823867,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO10.1",
      "start": 134.059,
      "end": 136.95521875,
      "window_end": 138.179,
      "text": "从来没有人刻意设定这些参数。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 30",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO10.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "f0fc3ddcca7d2d3e00a1f3e9ca093ac0144af7e3da8c6bc8d5886fa8f0ea8178",
      "source_in": 0.100406,
      "source_out": 3.159797,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO10.2",
      "start": 138.179,
      "end": 142.167875,
      "window_end": 142.179,
      "text": "相反，它们一开始是随机的，所以模型最初只会输出胡言乱语。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 31",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO10.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "f0fc3ddcca7d2d3e00a1f3e9ca093ac0144af7e3da8c6bc8d5886fa8f0ea8178",
      "source_in": 3.159797,
      "source_out": 8.3041565,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.2885851932433994,
      "local_tempo": 1.1986539672544079
    },
    {
      "id": "VO10.3",
      "start": 142.179,
      "end": 146.38978125,
      "window_end": 146.619,
      "text": "随后，模型会根据大量文本样本，反复调整这些参数。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 32",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO10.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "f0fc3ddcca7d2d3e00a1f3e9ca093ac0144af7e3da8c6bc8d5886fa8f0ea8178",
      "source_in": 8.3041565,
      "source_out": 12.820094,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.0886164735962165,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO11.1",
      "start": 146.619,
      "end": 148.582375,
      "window_end": 150.199,
      "text": "一个训练样本可能只有几个词，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 33",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO11.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "2f3c47deb1d15d58df9911bc9209e0952021234fe47857f242322f645d6eed2e",
      "source_in": 0.14025,
      "source_out": 2.1843909999999997,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO11.2",
      "start": 150.199,
      "end": 155.872625,
      "window_end": 157.779,
      "text": "也可能有数千个词。无论哪种情况，都要把除最后一个词外的内容输入模型，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 34",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO11.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "2f3c47deb1d15d58df9911bc9209e0952021234fe47857f242322f645d6eed2e",
      "source_in": 2.1843909999999997,
      "source_out": 8.21,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.3867905074288429,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO11.3",
      "start": 157.779,
      "end": 162.39625,
      "window_end": 162.439,
      "text": "再将模型的预测与样本中真实的最后一个词进行比较。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 35",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO11.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "2f3c47deb1d15d58df9911bc9209e0952021234fe47857f242322f645d6eed2e",
      "source_in": 8.21,
      "source_out": 13.097438,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.4924604866822353,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO12.1",
      "start": 162.439,
      "end": 168.92974999999998,
      "window_end": 172.719,
      "text": "一种名为“反向传播”的算法会调整所有参数，让模型选中真实的最后一个词的概率略微提高，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 36",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO12.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "00a0489cade8cff4f1df7634ceac72fcae09e351c3503757fc5a3167b7b36c54",
      "source_in": 0.261719,
      "source_out": 6.770875,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO12.2",
      "start": 172.719,
      "end": 175.1495,
      "window_end": 175.159,
      "text": "同时略微降低选择其他词的概率。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 37",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO12.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "00a0489cade8cff4f1df7634ceac72fcae09e351c3503757fc5a3167b7b36c54",
      "source_in": 6.770875,
      "source_out": 9.471688,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.23188271847200248,
      "local_tempo": 1.1094528008298765
    },
    {
      "id": "VO13.1",
      "start": 175.159,
      "end": 178.100875,
      "window_end": 179.579,
      "text": "在数万亿个样本上反复进行这一过程后，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 38",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO13.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "6495e219d438c481f0c7e3a03b70b97e4597a284f809edeeeb25abcd4e051e8a",
      "source_in": 0.09415599999999999,
      "source_out": 3.057766,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO13.2",
      "start": 179.579,
      "end": 182.3898125,
      "window_end": 183.479,
      "text": "模型不仅能更准确地预测训练数据，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 39",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO13.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "6495e219d438c481f0c7e3a03b70b97e4597a284f809edeeeb25abcd4e051e8a",
      "source_in": 3.057766,
      "source_out": 6.0448125,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.026673909297052045,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO13.3",
      "start": 183.479,
      "end": 186.286875,
      "window_end": 188.359,
      "text": "也能对从未见过的文本做出更合理的预测。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 40",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO13.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "6495e219d438c481f0c7e3a03b70b97e4597a284f809edeeeb25abcd4e051e8a",
      "source_in": 6.0448125,
      "source_out": 9.022375,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.23880796485260802,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO14.1",
      "start": 188.359,
      "end": 190.69862500000002,
      "window_end": 193.519,
      "text": "考虑到庞大的参数量与海量训练数据，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 41",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO14.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "ee06d83e4fbf0c0be36271d34ffe79b4f38fc6aaf89f377c44c006bddf0d77a4",
      "source_in": 0.25040599999999996,
      "source_out": 2.7560155,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO14.2",
      "start": 193.519,
      "end": 196.8789375,
      "window_end": 198.919,
      "text": "训练大语言模型所需的计算规模大得令人难以想象。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 42",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO14.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "ee06d83e4fbf0c0be36271d34ffe79b4f38fc6aaf89f377c44c006bddf0d77a4",
      "source_in": 2.7560155,
      "source_out": 6.6857185,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.03616826285953012,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO14.3",
      "start": 198.919,
      "end": 203.1076875,
      "window_end": 205.499,
      "text": "举个例子：假设你每秒钟能完成十亿次加法和乘法运算，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 43",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO14.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "ee06d83e4fbf0c0be36271d34ffe79b4f38fc6aaf89f377c44c006bddf0d77a4",
      "source_in": 6.6857185,
      "source_out": 11.461594000000002,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.22608131179138358,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO14.4",
      "start": 205.499,
      "end": 210.8265625,
      "window_end": 212.679,
      "text": "你觉得，要完成训练规模最大的语言模型所需的全部运算要花多久？",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 44",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO14.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "ee06d83e4fbf0c0be36271d34ffe79b4f38fc6aaf89f377c44c006bddf0d77a4",
      "source_in": 11.461594000000002,
      "source_out": 16.998281,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.1337560203637036,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO15.1",
      "start": 212.679,
      "end": 213.37025,
      "window_end": 215.159,
      "text": "一年够吗？",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 45",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO15.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "02441d8bc53bdb88aa76f653b8132058d0b5878ea61ae70d0c26860c1b46b96b",
      "source_in": 0.094969,
      "source_out": 1.397125,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO15.2",
      "start": 215.159,
      "end": 215.73003125,
      "window_end": 218.099,
      "text": "或许需要一万年？",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 46",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO15.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "02441d8bc53bdb88aa76f653b8132058d0b5878ea61ae70d0c26860c1b46b96b",
      "source_in": 1.397125,
      "source_out": 2.595703,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.3678239166036785,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO15.3",
      "start": 218.099,
      "end": 220.7883125,
      "window_end": 220.799,
      "text": "实际所需时间远不止这些。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 47",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO15.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "02441d8bc53bdb88aa76f653b8132058d0b5878ea61ae70d0c26860c1b46b96b",
      "source_in": 2.595703,
      "source_out": 6.1814845,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.23487497933988433,
      "local_tempo": 1.2292017790262093
    },
    {
      "id": "VO15.4",
      "start": 220.799,
      "end": 221.93540625,
      "window_end": 224.079,
      "text": "远远超过一亿年。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 48",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO15.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "02441d8bc53bdb88aa76f653b8132058d0b5878ea61ae70d0c26860c1b46b96b",
      "source_in": 6.1814845,
      "source_out": 8.0716565,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.5203285413202314,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO15.5",
      "start": 224.079,
      "end": 226.78865625,
      "window_end": 227.31900000000002,
      "text": "不过，这还只是整个训练过程的一部分。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 49",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO15.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "02441d8bc53bdb88aa76f653b8132058d0b5878ea61ae70d0c26860c1b46b96b",
      "source_in": 8.0716565,
      "source_out": 11.280344,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.6092236453766686,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO16.1",
      "start": 227.31900000000002,
      "end": 229.28053125000002,
      "window_end": 229.399,
      "text": "刚才讲的整个过程称为“预训练”。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 50",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO16.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5a782f6984e555e891da58ba1e6bd73c4855be4c6cbe9461da1c632bec31dab6",
      "source_in": 0.09365599999999999,
      "source_out": 2.351609,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO16.2",
      "start": 229.399,
      "end": 236.0885625,
      "window_end": 236.379,
      "text": "让模型自动续写互联网上的随机文本，与让它成为好用的 AI 助手，目标截然不同。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 51",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO16.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5a782f6984e555e891da58ba1e6bd73c4855be4c6cbe9461da1c632bec31dab6",
      "source_in": 2.351609,
      "source_out": 9.4726095,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.183985896593176,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO16.3",
      "start": 236.379,
      "end": 240.04315624999998,
      "window_end": 240.059,
      "text": "为此，聊天机器人还要经历另一种同样重要的训练，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 52",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO16.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5a782f6984e555e891da58ba1e6bd73c4855be4c6cbe9461da1c632bec31dab6",
      "source_in": 9.4726095,
      "source_out": 13.666875000000001,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.08463280254350636,
      "local_tempo": 1.1091352739726006
    },
    {
      "id": "VO16.4",
      "start": 240.059,
      "end": 242.48334375,
      "window_end": 243.819,
      "text": "叫作“基于人类反馈的强化学习”。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 53",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO16.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "5a782f6984e555e891da58ba1e6bd73c4855be4c6cbe9461da1c632bec31dab6",
      "source_in": 13.666875000000001,
      "source_out": 16.135313,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.013671710652133129,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO17.1",
      "start": 243.819,
      "end": 248.87546874999998,
      "window_end": 250.779,
      "text": "工作人员会标记无益或有问题的预测，他们的修正会进一步改变模型参数，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 54",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO17.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "df8194eab1125cf8f050dc261c67bc71b5095c60ae04011742e06e8c9b574a61",
      "source_in": 0.131469,
      "source_out": 5.2576875,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO17.2",
      "start": 250.779,
      "end": 253.5444375,
      "window_end": 254.879,
      "text": "让模型更有可能给出用户偏好的回答。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 55",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO17.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "df8194eab1125cf8f050dc261c67bc71b5095c60ae04011742e06e8c9b574a61",
      "source_in": 5.2576875,
      "source_out": 8.364016,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.1056250874463256,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO17.3",
      "start": 255.9,
      "end": 261.59328125,
      "window_end": 264.519,
      "text": "回顾预训练过程：如此惊人的计算量，有赖于专门优化过的计算机芯片，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 56; 经实际GPU/注意力/末向量画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO17.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "df8194eab1125cf8f050dc261c67bc71b5095c60ae04011742e06e8c9b574a61",
      "source_in": 8.364016,
      "source_out": 14.6135155,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.23254207709750574,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO17.4",
      "start": 264.519,
      "end": 267.59725000000003,
      "window_end": 267.619,
      "text": "它们能并行执行大量运算，这类芯片称为 GPU。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 57",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO17.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "df8194eab1125cf8f050dc261c67bc71b5095c60ae04011742e06e8c9b574a61",
      "source_in": 14.6135155,
      "source_out": 18.863125,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.02525757802778905,
      "local_tempo": 1.2818505700325638
    },
    {
      "id": "VO18.1",
      "start": 267.619,
      "end": 271.17315625000003,
      "window_end": 271.639,
      "text": "然而，并不是所有语言模型都容易实现并行处理。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 58",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO18.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "e7806bcefb3de7939e64c4dfb232fe7b50ce866b90f140a35871a41dd90fafab",
      "source_in": 0.094,
      "source_out": 3.9756405,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO18.2",
      "start": 271.639,
      "end": 276.19146875,
      "window_end": 276.919,
      "text": "在 2017 年以前，大多数语言模型都是逐词处理文本的。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 59",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO18.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "e7806bcefb3de7939e64c4dfb232fe7b50ce866b90f140a35871a41dd90fafab",
      "source_in": 3.9756405,
      "source_out": 8.879234,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.046362413007627445,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO18.3",
      "start": 276.919,
      "end": 281.498875,
      "window_end": 282.679,
      "text": "后来，谷歌的一组研究人员提出了名为 Transformer 的新模型。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 60",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO18.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "e7806bcefb3de7939e64c4dfb232fe7b50ce866b90f140a35871a41dd90fafab",
      "source_in": 8.879234,
      "source_out": 13.508844,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.23482220861678016,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO19.1",
      "start": 282.679,
      "end": 285.54137499999996,
      "window_end": 286.339,
      "text": "Transformer 不会从头到尾逐词阅读，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 61",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO19.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "951c9d07c45c6e23eb3257e266a80eaf647a4346078bb3315074625a5abf2cce",
      "source_in": 0.14153100000000002,
      "source_out": 3.039828,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO19.2",
      "start": 286.339,
      "end": 288.80765625,
      "window_end": 289.299,
      "text": "而是一次性并行处理整段文本。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 62",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO19.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "951c9d07c45c6e23eb3257e266a80eaf647a4346078bb3315074625a5abf2cce",
      "source_in": 3.039828,
      "source_out": 5.952172,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.03865712338061833,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO19.3",
      "start": 289.299,
      "end": 292.83937499999996,
      "window_end": 294.279,
      "text": "Transformer 的第一步，也是大多数语言模型的第一步，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 63",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO19.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "951c9d07c45c6e23eb3257e266a80eaf647a4346078bb3315074625a5abf2cce",
      "source_in": 5.952172,
      "source_out": 9.8195625,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.30590136771607845,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO19.4",
      "start": 294.279,
      "end": 297.3325625,
      "window_end": 297.579,
      "text": "是把每个词与一长串数字关联起来。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 64",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO19.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "951c9d07c45c6e23eb3257e266a80eaf647a4346078bb3315074625a5abf2cce",
      "source_in": 9.8195625,
      "source_out": 13.090437999999999,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.252163492722671,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO20.1",
      "start": 297.579,
      "end": 299.697125,
      "window_end": 302.299,
      "text": "因为训练过程只能处理连续数值，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 65",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO20.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bc9ce092b4f09f98d7bc563dd46f2d5426a84dc934dc114e09f5e8b1cf54b720",
      "source_in": 0.25931299999999996,
      "source_out": 2.5971405,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO20.2",
      "start": 302.299,
      "end": 305.1169375,
      "window_end": 305.559,
      "text": "所以必须用某种方式将语言编码为数字。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 66",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO20.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bc9ce092b4f09f98d7bc563dd46f2d5426a84dc934dc114e09f5e8b1cf54b720",
      "source_in": 2.5971405,
      "source_out": 5.9220939999999995,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.1310781948853612,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO20.3",
      "start": 305.559,
      "end": 309.66040625000005,
      "window_end": 310.359,
      "text": "每一串数字，都可能以某种方式编码着对应词语的含义。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 67",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO20.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bc9ce092b4f09f98d7bc563dd46f2d5426a84dc934dc114e09f5e8b1cf54b720",
      "source_in": 5.9220939999999995,
      "source_out": 10.326281,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.11896168153187237,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO21.1",
      "start": 311.0,
      "end": 315.483125,
      "window_end": 316.139,
      "text": "Transformer 的独特之处，在于它依靠一种称为“注意力”的特殊操作。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 68; 经实际GPU/注意力/末向量画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO21.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "b1581e1200979af36298d50dc02a29b8a00cd27d13341defd1e75011163f04ef",
      "source_in": 0.090375,
      "source_out": 4.891547,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO21.2",
      "start": 316.139,
      "end": 321.45984375,
      "window_end": 325.219,
      "text": "它让这些数字序列相互交流，结合周围的上下文，细化各自编码的含义。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 69",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO21.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "b1581e1200979af36298d50dc02a29b8a00cd27d13341defd1e75011163f04ef",
      "source_in": 4.891547,
      "source_out": 10.535530999999999,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.21894525669341025,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO22.1",
      "start": 325.219,
      "end": 326.70846875,
      "window_end": 326.719,
      "text": "而这一切都是并行完成的。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 70",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO22.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "960fff52a7bbdee05c865f4c2e2e6b90fd46ff4af0cc0784fb11964a806d0e82",
      "source_in": 0.329938,
      "source_out": 2.346375,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1.2206207482993197
    },
    {
      "id": "VO22.2",
      "start": 326.719,
      "end": 333.8290625,
      "window_end": 336.279,
      "text": "例如，编码 bank 的数字可以随上下文改变，从而表达更具体的含义——“河岸”。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 71",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO22.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "960fff52a7bbdee05c865f4c2e2e6b90fd46ff4af0cc0784fb11964a806d0e82",
      "source_in": 2.346375,
      "source_out": 9.868468499999999,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.1464927248677248,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO22.3",
      "start": 336.279,
      "end": 340.649375,
      "window_end": 343.219,
      "text": "Transformer 通常还包含另一类操作，叫作“前馈神经网络”。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 72",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO22.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "960fff52a7bbdee05c865f4c2e2e6b90fd46ff4af0cc0784fb11964a806d0e82",
      "source_in": 9.868468499999999,
      "source_out": 14.43025,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.5768706164021129,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO23.1",
      "start": 343.219,
      "end": 347.88768749999997,
      "window_end": 348.55899999999997,
      "text": "它为模型提供额外容量，用来存储训练中学到的更多语言模式。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 73",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO23.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "de7b767ec30077d8d7f178e2f66c3b7cdf2825e9e58d503df560cbb1757d428f",
      "source_in": 0.097,
      "source_out": 5.092594,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO23.2",
      "start": 348.55899999999997,
      "end": 352.9686875,
      "window_end": 354.819,
      "text": "数据会反复流过这两种基本操作，经过一轮又一轮的处理。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 74",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO23.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "de7b767ec30077d8d7f178e2f66c3b7cdf2825e9e58d503df560cbb1757d428f",
      "source_in": 5.092594,
      "source_out": 10.02875,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.05159073690614502,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO23.3",
      "start": 354.819,
      "end": 360.38646875,
      "window_end": 366.159,
      "text": "我们希望每个数字序列的表示逐渐丰富，包含准确预测下一个词所需的信息。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 75",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO23.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "de7b767ec30077d8d7f178e2f66c3b7cdf2825e9e58d503df560cbb1757d428f",
      "source_in": 10.02875,
      "source_out": 15.80625,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.3345129555887425,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO24.1",
      "start": 368.0,
      "end": 371.28725,
      "window_end": 373.0,
      "text": "最后，会对序列中的最后一个向量执行一个函数。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 76; 经实际GPU/注意力/末向量画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO24.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "1835acf75ed71db79820e55e78ec93e417d0ef809909b070ec66eb2a16f23be8",
      "source_in": 0.102563,
      "source_out": 3.5129375,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO24.2",
      "start": 373.0,
      "end": 377.3796875,
      "window_end": 377.8,
      "text": "此时，它已经受到输入文本中的所有其他上下文信息的影响，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 77; 经实际GPU/注意力/末向量画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO24.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "1835acf75ed71db79820e55e78ec93e417d0ef809909b070ec66eb2a16f23be8",
      "source_in": 3.5129375,
      "source_out": 8.178969,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.287352245527841,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO24.3",
      "start": 377.8,
      "end": 379.9818125,
      "window_end": 380.0,
      "text": "也融入了模型在训练中学到的信息，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 78; 经实际GPU/注意力/末向量画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO24.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "1835acf75ed71db79820e55e78ec93e417d0ef809909b070ec66eb2a16f23be8",
      "source_in": 8.178969,
      "source_out": 11.408406,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.3716829274376412,
      "local_tempo": 1.2641849078341079
    },
    {
      "id": "VO24.4",
      "start": 380.0,
      "end": 381.667,
      "window_end": 382.179,
      "text": "从而生成对下一个词的预测。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 79; 经实际GPU/注意力/末向量画面核对",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO24.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "1835acf75ed71db79820e55e78ec93e417d0ef809909b070ec66eb2a16f23be8",
      "source_in": 11.408406,
      "source_out": 13.466156,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.007536763416476688,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO25.1",
      "start": 382.179,
      "end": 386.2745625,
      "window_end": 387.439,
      "text": "同样，这个预测会为每个可能的后续词给出一个概率。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 80",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO25.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bfe7b9edfdd25b476cc9ad73929a7768e7e2997c838f066e286f34df77b07d23",
      "source_in": 0.11206200000000001,
      "source_out": 4.4381094999999995,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO25.2",
      "start": 387.439,
      "end": 389.68828125000005,
      "window_end": 392.359,
      "text": "虽然研究人员设计了各个步骤的框架，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 81",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO25.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bfe7b9edfdd25b476cc9ad73929a7768e7e2997c838f066e286f34df77b07d23",
      "source_in": 4.4381094999999995,
      "source_out": 7.057219,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.03253645173307351,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO25.3",
      "start": 392.359,
      "end": 399.08465624999997,
      "window_end": 401.959,
      "text": "但具体行为是训练中的涌现现象，取决于训练过程中如何调整数千亿个参数。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 82",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO25.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "bfe7b9edfdd25b476cc9ad73929a7768e7e2997c838f066e286f34df77b07d23",
      "source_in": 7.057219,
      "source_out": 13.970062,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.5524071742792351,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO26.1",
      "start": 401.959,
      "end": 406.320625,
      "window_end": 408.019,
      "text": "因此，要弄清模型为什么会做出这样的具体预测，极其困难。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 83",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO26.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "038a564b55edcf79c12fa194f971374a1e546c657d748266fde97361cbc9c7ba",
      "source_in": 0.099938,
      "source_out": 4.6042965,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO26.2",
      "start": 408.019,
      "end": 412.6040625,
      "window_end": 413.579,
      "text": "但你能看到：用大语言模型的预测自动续写一段提示词时，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 84",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO26.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "038a564b55edcf79c12fa194f971374a1e546c657d748266fde97361cbc9c7ba",
      "source_in": 4.6042965,
      "source_out": 9.3985155,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.5082865903790079,
      "local_tempo": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "VO26.3",
      "start": 413.579,
      "end": 416.70968750000003,
      "window_end": 416.739,
      "text": "生成的文字流畅得令人惊讶，",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 85",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO26.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "038a564b55edcf79c12fa194f971374a1e546c657d748266fde97361cbc9c7ba",
      "source_in": 9.3985155,
      "source_out": 12.8869685,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.8266506807580161,
      "local_tempo": 1.030541134185314
    },
    {
      "id": "VO26.4",
      "start": 416.739,
      "end": 418.42571875,
      "window_end": 419.0,
      "text": "引人入胜，甚至还很有用。",
      "visual_cue": "原字幕 86",
      "source": "生成/配音/VO26.mp3",
      "source_sha256": "038a564b55edcf79c12fa194f971374a1e546c657d748266fde97361cbc9c7ba",
      "source_in": 12.8869685,
      "source_out": 14.711687999999999,
      "cut_error_estimate": 0.10551077405247966,
      "local_tempo": 1
    }
  ],
